sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User query<br/>(what did I do last week?)
    participant RUN as runner.go<br/>composeAgent + ReAct
    participant G as Intent gate (cheap LLM)<br/>retrieve? which kind?
    participant R as Source router<br/>select memory buckets
    participant S1 as Timeline search<br/>(memory_events)
    participant S2 as Graph search<br/>(memory_entities / edges)
    participant S3 as HDM search<br/>(memory_notes)
    participant I as Integrate + cite<br/>(merge, union citations)
    participant A as Atlas<br/>(main LLM)

    U->>RUN: turn arrives
    RUN->>G: classify this turn
    alt no retrieval needed
        G-->>RUN: pass through - zero added latency
        RUN->>A: ReAct on working memory alone
    else retrieval needed
        G->>R: pick buckets
        R->>S1: dispatch
        R->>S2: dispatch
        R->>S3: dispatch
        Note over S1,S3: 3 concurrent agentic searches - one per memory<br/>dense + lexical rerank, filters, read on demand
        par episodic - memory_events
            S1->>S1: dense + lexical with time-window filter
        and associative - entity graph
            S2->>S2: seed match => relation traversal
        and semantic - HDM
            S3->>S3: read ladder L0 => L1 => L2, capped opens
        end
        S1->>I: grounded hits + opened evidence
        S2->>I: grounded hits + opened evidence
        S3->>I: grounded hits + opened evidence
        I->>I: merge - union citations - one confidence score
        Note over I: citation lock - only opened evidence citable<br/>nothing opened = abstain
        I-->>RUN: grounded context, cited
        RUN->>A: ReAct with grounded context
        A-->>U: grounded answer + confidence + citations
    end
